flowchart LR
  game[Local Star Citizen install\nData.p4k + global.ini] --> extract[Extract fresh global.ini]
  game --> datacore[DataCore cache refresh\nDCB/XML extraction]
  scmdb[SCMDB web data] --> scmdbcache[SCMDB cache refresh]
  datacore --> sourcecsv[Versioned source outputs\ncsv/datacore/*]
  scmdbcache --> sourcecsv
  sourcecsv --> planning[Application use cases\npatch planning + diagnostics]
  rules[Item and mission rule modules\nsrc/items/*] --> planning
  planning --> localization[Localization patch application\nsrc/localization/*]
  localization --> repo[Repo global.ini]
  repo --> deploy[Deploy to game localization path]
